      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiddletown%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1854 Fiddletown had over 2,000 residents, becoming a bustling Gold Rush hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
